MODULE: SwapOnlyAfterCopyAndFenceEarlyFlip
TARGET: SwapOnlyAfterCopyAndFence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the alias flips before every captured old shard refuses stale routing
PERTURBS: ResizeSwap

--- FIND
    /\ fenced = captured
    /\ alias' = "resized" /\ phase' = "complete"
--- REPLACE
    /\ fenced \subseteq captured
    /\ alias' = "resized" /\ phase' = "complete"
--- END
